{"4266640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rest & Reel", "steam_appid": 4266640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Rest &amp; Reel</strong>, a cozy fishing game focused on calm moments, quiet lakes, and the simple joy of fishing <br>It’s all about taking your time and enjoying the atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can expect:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy fishing gameplay with simple, satisfying mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch different types of fish and see how big they are</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your fish and earn money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your fishing rod and backpack to catch more and better fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no timers, no stress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow, peaceful pace you control</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play for a few minutes or stay for a while, <strong>Rest &amp; Reel</strong> is made to feel calm, comfy, and easy to enjoy. Just you, the world, and the next bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266640/extras/19148c1750bb35144b44d2eb134afb27.avif?t=1778106032\" width=1560 height=203 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266640/extras/927dff42ade8a6a9ac74c6e7a82da086.poster.avif?t=1778106032\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266640/extras/927dff42ade8a6a9ac74c6e7a82da086.webm?t=1778106032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/